{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>And Kittim.</b> Of the descendants of Javan, for so it is written. And it is fitting that it be an allusion to the kingdom of Javan. I have already explained in the book of Daniel that the kingdom of Javan and Kittim are one, and it is the third beast in the visions." "<b>From the hand of Kittim.</b> Meaning 'from the place,' like עַל יַד הַיַּרְדֵּן (Genesis 13:10) and וְיָד תְּהִי לְךָ." "<b>And it too.</b> כְּתִים — it is a singular noun. And if it be according to the rule of plural language, the proof is וּבְנֵי יָוָן אֱלִישָׁה וְתַרְשִׁישׁ כִּתִּים (Genesis 10:4)."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:19:25.315260395Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}